From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: musa <musa@local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:09:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA: make DeepEncoder LOG2E a Triton constexpr

The SAM relative-position attention kernel reads LOG2E, a plain float
imported from vllm.triton_utils. Triton rejects non-constexpr globals in
@triton.jit code, so the kernel fails to compile and the DeepSeek-OCR
vision encoder cannot run.
---
 vllm/model_executor/models/deepencoder.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/vllm/model_executor/models/deepencoder.py b/vllm/model_executor/models/deepencoder.py
index fa972ca615..3ed88a02af 100644
--- a/vllm/model_executor/models/deepencoder.py
+++ b/vllm/model_executor/models/deepencoder.py
@@ -28,6 +28,8 @@ from vllm.triton_utils import LOG2E, tl, triton
 from .clip import CLIPEncoder, CLIPVisionEmbeddings
 from .utils import AutoWeightsLoader
 
+LOG2E = tl.constexpr(LOG2E)
+
 
 @triton.jit
 def _deepencoder_rel_pos_attention_kernel(
